000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SETINDEX.
000300* Table Handling level 1: USAGE IS INDEX and the SET statement.
000400* An index here holds the occurrence number rather than a
000500* displacement, which the standard allows -- the form is the
000600* implementor's choice -- so every valid combination in the chart
000700* on III-12 is an integer move or an integer add.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
